    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brass Lament is a 2D interactive story-driven experience about war, memory, and the emotional struggles of ordinary people caught in the chaos of conflict. Players step into fragmented recollections, through the memory of the aging soldier, reliving four distinct lives: the weary soldier himself, a wandering child, a rebel fighter, and a war journalist capturing the silence between gunshots. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With unique interactions, players can relive the fear of the little girl cuddling her teddy during an aerial attack, walk down the street feeling the trauma and lingering tension of war, and confront the sense of powerlessness while witnessing death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>--------------------------------------------Features---------------------------------------------</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the world through swipe, drag, hold, and feel the way through each memory.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563530/extras/23ccf059a68c7583e8822c5b2e968019.poster.avif?t=1748415230\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563530/extras/23ccf059a68c7583e8822c5b2e968019.webm?t=1748415230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563530/extras/23ccf059a68c7583e8822c5b2e968019.mp4?t=1748415230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Text</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the story through scattered clues and fragmented texts, and reflect on the emotions you choose to carry.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563530/extras/f5ef24d11f05ad738d084bb810bd9b3a.poster.avif?t=1748415230\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563530/extras/f5ef24d11f05ad738d084bb810bd9b3a.webm?t=1748415230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563530/extras/f5ef24d11f05ad738d084bb810bd9b3a.mp4?t=1748415230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four stories, seemingly separate, slowly intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the silence between shellfire, trust is tested, conflicts ignite, and the deepest layers of humanity begin to surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563530/extras/66e5f101e2dd456455eff05a51254c45.poster.avif?t=1748415230\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563530/extras/66e5f101e2dd456455eff05a51254c45.webm?t=1748415230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563530/extras/66e5f101e2dd456455eff05a51254c45.mp4?t=1748415230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war will end</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The leaders will shake hands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The old woman will keep waiting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for her martyred son</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That girl will wait for her beloved husband</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And those children will wait for their heroic father</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I don't know who sold our homeland</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But I know who paid the price</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014<strong>Mahmoud Darwish</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brass Lament is a 2D interactive story-driven experience about war, memory, and the emotional struggles of ordinary people caught in the chaos of conflict. Players step into fragmented recollections, through the memory of the aging soldier, reliving four distinct lives: the weary soldier himself, a wandering child, a rebel fighter, and a war journalist capturing the silence between gunshots. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With unique interactions, players can relive the fear of the little girl cuddling her teddy during an aerial attack, walk down the street feeling the trauma and lingering tension of war, and confront the sense of powerlessness while witnessing death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>--------------------------------------------Features---------------------------------------------</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the world through swipe, drag, hold, and feel the way through each memory.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563530/extras/23ccf059a68c7583e8822c5b2e968019.poster.avif?t=1748415230\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563530/extras/23ccf059a68c7583e8822c5b2e968019.webm?t=1748415230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563530/extras/23ccf059a68c7583e8822c5b2e968019.mp4?t=1748415230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Text</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the story through scattered clues and fragmented texts, and reflect on the emotions you choose to carry.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563530/extras/f5ef24d11f05ad738d084bb810bd9b3a.poster.avif?t=1748415230\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563530/extras/f5ef24d11f05ad738d084bb810bd9b3a.webm?t=1748415230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563530/extras/f5ef24d11f05ad738d084bb810bd9b3a.mp4?t=1748415230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four stories, seemingly separate, slowly intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the silence between shellfire, trust is tested, conflicts ignite, and the deepest layers of humanity begin to surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563530/extras/66e5f101e2dd456455eff05a51254c45.poster.avif?t=1748415230\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563530/extras/66e5f101e2dd456455eff05a51254c45.webm?t=1748415230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563530/extras/66e5f101e2dd456455eff05a51254c45.mp4?t=1748415230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war will end</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The leaders will shake hands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The old woman will keep waiting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for her martyred son</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That girl will wait for her beloved husband</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And those children will wait for their heroic father</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I don't know who sold our homeland</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But I know who paid the price</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014<strong>Mahmoud Darwish</strong></p>",
